WEBVTT

1
00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:21.280
Inaudit is a performative investigation

2
00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:23.000
into sound and the body,

3
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.540
exploring unheard and inaudible sonic
memory

4
00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:30.660
in buildings, landscapes, streets, houses:

5
00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:34.700
places with a heritage of their own,

6
00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:38.520
an intimate world of sound we cannot hear,

7
00:00:38.840 --> 00:00:41.980
which we investigate and discover through
this piece,

8
00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:44.900
sharing experiences with the audience that
change

9
00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:47.800
with each different performance we create.

10
00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:51.000
A space filled with distinctive sounds

11
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:54.660
and a historical weight that has fallen on
our shoulders

12
00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:56.860
and has been difficult to deal with.

13
00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:05.380
We have treated the memory of this place
with great respect,

14
00:01:05.660 --> 00:01:08.400
because anything we might say,

15
00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:11.320
anything we might do or wear,

16
00:01:12.120 --> 00:01:14.800
anything that happens in this space

17
00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:16.920
carries so many meanings,

18
00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:22.260
and the way it affected us was quite
paralysing.

19
00:01:25.420 --> 00:01:27.280
Creació i Museus is sonic heritage.

20
00:01:27.820 --> 00:01:30.120
Creació i Museus means going beyond the
layers.
